# php-fileinfo overlay: magic entries of php-src master's bundled libmagic
# 5.48 database (ext/fileinfo/data_file.c, decompiled) that the system
# libmagic 5.45 database describes differently.  It is loaded in front of
# the default database, so its top-level tests are tried first and its
# named (`name`) blocks replace the system ones that `use` refers to.
#
# * `<?xml version=` (Magdir/sgml): 5.48 marks it string/bt (+50), so it
#   also runs in the text pass over UTF-16 converted to UTF-8 (GH-11891).
# * `<?php` (Magdir/commands): strength +55 in 5.48, above the JavaScript
#   regexes (+20), so PHP with closures is text/x-php (GH-17039).
# * UF2 (Magdir/firmware): 5.48's family table and "base address".
# * `arj-archive` (Magdir/archive): 5.48 prints the creation/modification
#   dates with lemsdosdate/lemsdostime.  5.45 formats a DOS date as
#   "%a, %b %d %Y" without clamping the month, so `php-msdosdate` spells
#   out 5.48's file_fmtdate() ("%b %d %Y", invalid months as January).
0	string/tb	\<?xml\ version=
!:strength +50
>14	regex	['"\ \t]*[0-9.]+['"\ \t]*
>>19	search/4096	\<svg	SVG Scalable Vector Graphics image
!:mime	image/svg+xml
!:ext	svg
>>19	search/4096	\<gnc-v2	GnuCash file
!:mime	application/x-gnucash
>>19	search/4096	application/x-qtskin	QuickTime5 skinned movie
!:mime	application/x-qtskin

0	search/1/c	\<?php	PHP script text
!:strength +55
!:mime	text/x-php

